Dave Hairston was publishing the Nethack Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ)
but he's leaving his site and is passing the publication on to me, since
I have a way to automate the posting.  It's somewhat obvious that we get
a lot of articles posted here on r.g.h with questions that are answered
in the FAQ.  I plan on posting the FAQ twice-weekly.  Some sites have only
a very few days for article retention, and some users must be missing
them.  I'll publish on Mondays and Thursdays.  Hopefully, two FAQ postings
a week will cut down on the everpresent "where can I find Nethack" question,
and perhaps cut down on some of the other frequent questions, like "where can
I find the spoilers?"

You may see some double-posting until D.H. turns off his automated poster.

I'll be using Dave's document to begin with.  If you'd like changes made,
just send me e-mail any time.
